---Abstract base of all entities in the game. Entity is nearly everything that can be on the map (except tiles).
---
---For in game script access to entity, take a look at [LuaEntity](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/classes/LuaEntity.html).
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/EntityPrototype.html)
