---
---Names of the entity prototypes this entity prototype can be pasted on to in addition to the standard supported types.
---
---This is used to allow copying between types that aren't compatible on the C++ code side, by allowing mods to receive the [on\_entity\_settings\_pasted](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/events.html#on_entity_settings_pasted) event for the given entity and do the setting pasting via script.
---
