---
---Supported values are 1 (for 1x1 grid) and 2 (for 2x2 grid, like rails).
---
---Internally forced to be `2` for [RailPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RailPrototype.html), [RailRemnantsPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RailRemnantsPrototype.html), [TrainStopPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/TrainStopPrototype.html), [RailSupportPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RailSupportPrototype.html) and [CargoBayPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/CargoBayPrototype.html).
---
---Internally forced to be `256` for [SpacePlatformHubPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/SpacePlatformHubPrototype.html).
