---Amount of emissions created (positive number) or cleaned (negative number) every second by the entity. This is passive and currently used just for trees and fires. This is independent of the [emissions of energy sources](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/BaseEnergySource.html%23emissions_per_minute#emissions_per_minute) used by machines, which are created actively depending on the power consumption.
---
