---
---Name of the entity that will be automatically selected as the upgrade of this entity when using the [upgrade planner](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/UpgradeItemPrototype.html) without configuration.
---
---This entity may not have "not-upgradable" flag set and must be minable. This entity mining result must not contain item product with [hidden](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemPrototype.html%23hidden#hidden) set to `true`. Mining results with no item products are allowed. This entity may not be a [RollingStockPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RollingStockPrototype.html).
---
---The upgrade target entity needs to have the same bounding box, collision mask, and fast replaceable group as this entity. The upgrade target entity must have least 1 item that builds it that isn't hidden.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/EntityPrototype.html%23next_upgrade#next_upgrade)
---@field next_upgrade? EntityID
---@
