---Used to determine how the center of the entity should be positioned when building (unless the off-grid [flag](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/EntityPrototypeFlags.html) is specified).
---
---When the tile width is odd, the center will be in the center of the tile, when it is even, the center is on the tile transition.
